{"full":"hf:Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP","spaceId":"Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP","name":"MedCodeMCP","source":"huggingface","description":"an MCP Tool for Symptom-to-ICD Diagnosis Mapping.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","mcp-server-track","agent-demo-track","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":3,"created":"2025-06-07T15:14:33.000Z","updated":"2025-06-10T14:47:51.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://agents-mcp-hackathon-medcodemcp.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.252Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.252Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.252Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"💬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MedCodeMCP is a voice-enabled medical diagnosis assistant that maps patient symptoms to probable ICD-10 codes and explanations. It leverages automatic speech recognition (ASR) (via Whisper) to transcribe spoken complaints and then engages an interactive Q&A session with the user to clarify symptoms.","Under the hood, it uses a Large Language Model (LLM) to either ask focused follow-up questions or output a final diagnosis suggestion in JSON format (with fields for diagnoses and confidence scores). The application integrates a vector database of ICD-10 descriptions using LlamaIndex for retrieval: given symptoms, it finds relevant ICD-10 code information to inform the LLM’s reasoning.","Graham Paasch is an AI realist passionate about the coming AI revolution."],"features":["Automatic speech recognition (ASR): Transcribe real-time patient audio using Gradio.","Interactive Q&A Agent: The LLM dynamically asks clarifying questions base on ICD codes until it can diagnose with high confidence.","ICD-10 Mapping: Use LlamaIndex for vector retrieval of probable ICD-10 codes with confidence scores.","MCP-Server Ready: Exposes a /mcp REST endpoint for seamless agent integration."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e280ec5f7c2ff489947f5d6175cc1cc7747ac9f7667823a788ee850b9466f020","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.291Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.291Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MedCodeMCP is a voice-enabled medical diagnosis assistant that maps patient symptoms to probable ICD-10 codes and explanations. It leverages automatic speech recognition (ASR) (via Whisper) to transcribe spoken complaints and then engages an interactive Q&A session with the user to clarify symptoms.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e280ec5f7c2ff489947f5d6175cc1cc7747ac9f7667823a788ee850b9466f020","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.291Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-06-10T14:47:51.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/MedCodeMCP/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T11:03:12.291Z","hash":"e280ec5f7c2ff489947f5d6175cc1cc7747ac9f7667823a788ee850b9466f020","originalBytes":10633,"storedBytes":10633,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["credits","api","first","participants","huggingface.co","billing","hugging","face","mcp","gradio","hackathon","usage","hours","icd-10","june","llamaindex","office","youtube","hyperbolic","labs","modal","team","agents-mcp-hackathon","cloud","dashboard","llm","mistral","mistralai","nebius","openai","participant","sambanova","submission","watch","account","agent","anthropic","app.py","codes","demo","diagnosis","medcodemcp","monitor","sambanova.ai","short","space","support","transcribe","venv","video","work","abid","abidlabs","about","abubakar","activate","advocate","agent-demo-tra